  "scenario": "You operate a business application used heavily by employees between 9:00 AM and 5:00 PM.\n\n1.  **Base Load:** You need a minimum of 1 server running at all times.\n2.  **Peak Load:** You know traffic spikes every day at 8:55 AM. You cannot wait for the system to react; you want 2 extra servers ready _before_ the employees log in.\n3.  **Distribution:** All traffic must be balanced across these dynamic servers.\n\nAs the Cloud Engineer, you must:\n\n1.  Create a **Security Group** and **Launch Template** (The Blueprint).\n2.  Deploy an **Application Load Balancer** (The Traffic Director).\n3.  Create an **Auto Scaling Group** (The Fleet Manager).\n4.  Configure a **Scheduled Action** to scale out automatically at a specific time.\n\n---",
